From d54da95edd1d0653160047225d2a3f83199d9c53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 13:37:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Normalize remaining live Dashboard/Home clean-route
 references (NJW-179)

Mechanical .html-suffix removal across 35 files that ChatGPT's GitHub
connector could not safely edit (large/minified files it truncates on
read). All changes are exact substring swaps of /property/dashboard.html
-> /property/dashboard and /property/home.html -> /property/home;
every query string, hash fragment, and URL-encoded param is preserved
byte-for-byte.

Includes:
- Shared navigation: property/index.html, nav.html, footer.html,
  account.html, offline.html
- Active app pages: agent-desk.html, developer-data.html, pulse.html,
  marker.html, tools.html, property-analysis.html, faq/index.html,
  backoffice/index.html, marketing-studio-admin.html
- Live JS consumers: marker-detail.js, scan.js, agent-desk.js, lookup.js,
  dashboard/index.js, dashboard/home/index.js, 4x dashboard/tools/*.js,
  data-workbench.js, landing-showcase.js, marketing-studio.js,
  marketing-studio-wizard.js, public-nav.js, billing-client.js,
  backoffice.js, backoffice-recovery.js, root senior-benefits.js
- property/tests/agent-opportunity-desk.mjs updated to certify
  /property/home?pin= now that agent-desk.js emits the clean route
- .github/workflows/repair-property-nav.yml updated to require the
  clean routes in property/index.html instead of the retired .html
  paths, since that workflow checks property/index.html verbatim

Explicitly NOT touched:
- property/data/versions.json, root versions.json (historical/changelog)
- property/property/* (known-dead deployment-manifest artifact)
- property/insights/index.html (Insights excluded per assignment)
- vercel.json (these ARE the legacy redirects, must stay)
- root home.html, scan.html, sidemenu.html, sidemenu.js, index (1).js,
  index (2).js (separate orphaned-root-cluster cleanup, pending
  traffic verification, not part of NJW-179 scope)
- supabase/functions/watchdog-test-auth/index.ts (backend edge
  function; repo-vs-deployed drift is a known risk for this family
  of files per NJW-141, out of stated scope, flagged for separate
  handling)

Tests run locally:
- property/tests/agent-opportunity-desk.mjs: PASS
- property/scripts/audit_access_boundaries.mjs: 54/55 pass; the one
  failure (marketing-studio.html access-guard check) reproduces
  identically on the unmodified base commit -- pre-existing, tracked
  separately as NJW-180, not caused by this change
- verify-release.mjs, property/tests/security-contracts.mjs,
  property/tests/marketing-creative-contracts.mjs: all fail
  identically on the unmodified base commit -- pre-existing,
  unrelated to routing
- property/tests/marketing-discovery-contracts.mjs: PASS
